# Local development example only. Never commit real secrets.
#
# Android payment backend URL is supplied as an environment variable to Gradle:
# PAYMENT_API_URL=https://your-payment-backend.example
#
# Server-side variables belong only in the cloud function environment:
# YOOKASSA_SHOP_ID
# YOOKASSA_SECRET_KEY
# PAYMENT_AMOUNT_RUB=490
# TG_BOT_TOKEN
# TG_ADMIN_CHAT_ID
# FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=kapterka-pro
#
# Configure ONE of these only on the server:
# FIREBASE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_JSON
# FIREBASE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_B64
# Admin backend only (never put plaintext admin key into GitHub or APK):
# ADMIN_API_SECRET_SHA256=
# ADMIN_SESSION_SECRET=
